  "id": "gender-concept",
  "term": "gender concept",
  "definition": "Gender concept refers to the way gender is understood or organized, such as within a binary framework of male/female or outside that framework. In this source, a binary gender concept means identifying with one of the two socially recognized genders, while non-binary or gender-diverse identities may involve identifying with both, between, or neither.",
